flowchart LR
  REQ([Requirement]) --> SPEC[Specify]
  SPEC -- Q-SPEC-n --> H1{{Human: answer + gate after-specify}}
  H1 -->|approved| DEC[Decompose] --> DES[Design] --> ARC[Architect]
  ARC -- VIOLATION --> DES
  ARC -- CONFIRMED --> H2{{Human gate after-architect}}
  H2 -->|approved| COD[Coding · test first]
  COD --> VER[Deterministic checks]
  VER -- FAIL --> COD
  VER -- PASS --> QA[QA · different mode]
  QA -- FAIL --> COD
  QA -- PASS --> INT[Integrate] --> DOC[Document] --> TR[Trace]
  TR --> H3{{Human gate before-merge}}
  H3 -->|approved| PR([Draft PR ready for review])
  classDef human fill:#f1ebfd,stroke:#6941c6
  class H1,H2,H3 human
